[en.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_EDUCATION]
More Socerers

[en.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_EDUCATION_desc]
The power of a region is inseparable from the support of magic, and the inheritance of magic is inseparable from magic education, especially in the current situation where the magic of all ponies has been greatly weakened. The importance of magic education is self-evident. Ponies must set their minds right: magic is not the privilege of unicorns, but the common right of all ponies,  and the common obligation of all ponies... I guess?\n§g“They really should have picked a unicorn to teach magic.” - Teacher Cheerilee.§!

[zh.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_EDUCATION]
多来点法师

[zh.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_EDUCATION_desc]
一个地区的强大离不开魔法的支持，而魔法的传承则离不开魔法教育。尤其是在所有小马的魔法都已经被大幅削弱的现状下，魔法教育的重要性更是不言而喻。小马们必须要摆正心态：魔法不是独角兽的特权，而是所有小马的共同权利，和义务...也许？\n§g“他们真应该选一只独角兽来教魔法的”——车厘子老师。§!

